{
  "book": "mosiah",
  "bookName": "Mosiah",
  "chapter": 1,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 361.128,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.523,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now there was no more contention in all the land of Zarahemla, among all the people who belonged to king Benjamin,",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 7.703,
      "end": 12.672,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "so that king Benjamin had continual peace all the remainder of his days.",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 13.352,
      "end": 16.185,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he had three sons;",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 16.365,
      "end": 20.312,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he called their names Mosiah, and Helorum, and Helaman.",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 20.492,
      "end": 24.393,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he caused that they should be taught in all the language of his fathers,",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 24.573,
      "end": 27.963,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they might become men of understanding;",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 28.143,
      "end": 31.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that they might know concerning the prophecies",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 31.481,
      "end": 34.685,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which had been spoken by the mouths of their fathers,",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 34.865,
      "end": 38.255,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were delivered them by the hand of the Lord.",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 38.935,
      "end": 41.582,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also taught them concerning the records",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 41.762,
      "end": 45.338,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were engraven on the plates of brass, saying:",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 45.518,
      "end": 50.348,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "My sons, I would that ye should remember that were it not for these plates,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 50.528,
      "end": 53.686,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which contain these records and these commandments,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 53.866,
      "end": 56.374,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we must have suffered in ignorance,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 56.554,
      "end": 58.551,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even at this present time,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 58.731,
      "end": 61.192,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "not knowing the mysteries of God.",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 61.872,
      "end": 65.216,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For it were not possible that our father, Lehi,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 65.396,
      "end": 67.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "could have remembered all these things,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 67.619,
      "end": 69.941,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to have taught them to his children,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 70.121,
      "end": 73.047,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except it were for the help of these plates;",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 73.227,
      "end": 76.849,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he having been taught in the language of the Egyptians",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 77.029,
      "end": 79.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he could read these engravings,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 79.67,
      "end": 81.76,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and teach them to his children,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 81.94,
      "end": 84.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they could teach them to their children,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 85.092,
      "end": 87.646,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and so fulfilling the commandments of God,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 87.826,
      "end": 90.009,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even down to this present time.",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 90.689,
      "end": 92.361,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you, my sons,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 92.541,
      "end": 94.352,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "were it not for these things,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 94.532,
      "end": 98.201,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which have been kept and preserved by the hand of God,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 98.381,
      "end": 101.91,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we might read and understand of his mysteries,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 102.09,
      "end": 105.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have his commandments always before our eyes,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 105.335,
      "end": 108.354,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that even our fathers would have dwindled in unbelief,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 108.534,
      "end": 112.389,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we should have been like unto our brethren, the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 112.569,
      "end": 115.216,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who know nothing concerning these things,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 115.396,
      "end": 123.291,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or even do not believe them when they are taught them, because of the traditions of their fathers, which are not correct.",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 123.971,
      "end": 125.086,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O my sons,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 125.266,
      "end": 128.517,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would that ye should remember that these sayings are true,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 128.697,
      "end": 131.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also that these records are true.",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 131.338,
      "end": 134.032,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, also the plates of Nephi,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 134.212,
      "end": 141.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which contain the records and the sayings of our fathers from the time they left Jerusalem until now,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 141.869,
      "end": 143.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they are true;",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 143.303,
      "end": 145.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we can know of their surety",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 146.037,
      "end": 148.591,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because we have them before our eyes.",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 149.271,
      "end": 150.664,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my sons,",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 150.844,
      "end": 152.841,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would that ye should remember",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 153.021,
      "end": 154.971,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to search them diligently,",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 155.151,
      "end": 157.055,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may profit thereby;",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 157.235,
      "end": 160.764,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I would that ye should keep the commandments of God,",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 160.944,
      "end": 166.749,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may prosper in the land according to the promises which the Lord made unto our fathers.",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 167.429,
      "end": 170.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And many more things did king Benjamin teach his sons,",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 171.092,
      "end": 173.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which are not written in this book.",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 173.722,
      "end": 181.245,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after king Benjamin had made an end of teaching his sons, that he waxed old,",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 181.425,
      "end": 185.094,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he saw that he must very soon go the way of all the earth;",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 185.274,
      "end": 191.125,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, he thought it expedient that he should confer the kingdom upon one of his sons.",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 191.805,
      "end": 194.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, he had Mosiah brought before him;",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 194.864,
      "end": 197.836,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and these are the words which he spake unto him, saying:",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 198.016,
      "end": 199.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "My son,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 199.264,
      "end": 206.509,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would that ye should make a proclamation throughout all this land among all this people, or the people of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 206.689,
      "end": 209.568,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the people of Mosiah who dwell in the land,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 209.748,
      "end": 212.442,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they may be gathered together;",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 212.622,
      "end": 217.405,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for on the morrow I shall proclaim unto this my people out of mine own mouth",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 217.585,
      "end": 220.975,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thou art a king and a ruler over this people,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 221.155,
      "end": 223.477,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whom the Lord our God hath given us.",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 224.157,
      "end": 227.268,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And moreover, I shall give this people a name,",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 227.448,
      "end": 231.163,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they may be distinguished above all the people",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 231.343,
      "end": 234.965,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which the Lord God hath brought out of the land of Jerusalem;",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 235.145,
      "end": 241.043,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this I do because they have been a diligent people in keeping the commandments of the Lord.",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 241.723,
      "end": 245.624,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I give unto them a name that never shall be blotted out,",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 245.804,
      "end": 248.033,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except it be through transgression.",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 248.713,
      "end": 251.128,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and moreover I say unto you",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 251.308,
      "end": 255.998,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that if this highly favored people of the Lord should fall into transgression,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 256.178,
      "end": 259.615,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and become a wicked and an adulterous people,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 259.795,
      "end": 262.024,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Lord will deliver them up,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 262.204,
      "end": 265.78,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they become weak like unto their brethren;",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 265.96,
      "end": 270.465,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he will no more preserve them by his matchless and marvelous power,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 270.645,
      "end": 273.199,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as he has hitherto preserved our fathers.",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 273.879,
      "end": 275.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I say unto you",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 275.638,
      "end": 280.375,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that if he had not extended his arm in the preservation of our fathers",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 280.555,
      "end": 283.899,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they must have fallen into the hands of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 284.079,
      "end": 286.494,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and become victims to their hatred.",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 287.174,
      "end": 292.561,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after king Benjamin had made an end of these sayings to his son,",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 292.741,
      "end": 296.967,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he gave him charge concerning all the affairs of the kingdom.",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 297.647,
      "end": 301.455,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And moreover, he also gave him charge concerning the records",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 301.635,
      "end": 304.468,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were engraven on the plates of brass;",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 304.648,
      "end": 310.546,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also the plates of Nephi, and also, the sword of Laban, and the ball or director,",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 310.726,
      "end": 313.373,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which led our fathers through the wilderness,",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 313.553,
      "end": 316.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was prepared by the hand of the Lord",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 316.473,
      "end": 323.207,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they might be led, every one according to the heed and diligence which they gave unto him.",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 323.887,
      "end": 326.441,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, as they were unfaithful",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 326.621,
      "end": 329.686,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they did not prosper nor progress in their journey,",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 329.866,
      "end": 331.445,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but were driven back,",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 331.625,
      "end": 334.365,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and incurred the displeasure of God upon them;",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 334.545,
      "end": 338.678,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and therefore they were smitten with famine and sore afflictions,",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 338.858,
      "end": 341.644,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to stir them up in remembrance of their duty.",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 342.324,
      "end": 347.154,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, it came to pass that Mosiah went and did as his father had commanded him,",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 347.334,
      "end": 351.467,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and proclaimed unto all the people who were in the land of Zarahemla",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 351.647,
      "end": 355.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they might gather themselves together,",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 355.264,
      "end": 357.958,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to go up to the temple to hear the words",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 358.138,
      "end": 360.46,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which his father should speak unto them.",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 102
    }
  ]
}